    <rdfs:comment>Patient_ICU(?p) ∧ Situation_Futility(?cs) ∧ hasTreatmentOption(?p,?opt) ∧ hasProbabilitySurvival(?opt,?prob) ∧ swrlb:lessThan(?prob,0.01) → LimitTreatment(?opt)</rdfs:comment>
